{
  "description": "SCB: one register per label-rule claim (LKF, PAIR, MULTI, SPLIT 2019-2021, CONTRAC, CONTRAL, OVR) with Vardemangder version names; plus the sample VALUE. SOS workbook CLS (subset CLS_A 2019-2020): one variable per conformance or declaration claim, each with a Kodlista; UNK, UNRESURL and UNRESFRAG are each delivered twice with two declarations; WHELD declares FIX once. FK registers openreg (open from 2010), span (2019-2021), overlap (2020), none (1990-1991), pooled (a pooled 2020-2021 variant) and nocodes. Canonical-SCB register canon with OUTCOL (list 'outside'), TWOCOL (list 01) and MEMBERS (no book; list 01 'Participation' twice, 1, a labelled blank and 01 'Another label'), DUPLAB (book FIX; list 01 under two labels, 02 with an empty label) and BLANKB (book FIX; list 01 and a labelled blank code). Books FIX/ALT (01, 02), TWO (02), SEN (01, 02; sentinel 00000), HUN (0-98), families pair (OLD 2000-2019, NEW 2020-) and overlap (P1 2000-2020, P2 2020-), DIG and CNF.",
